001669                    ; ---- the central comparison: read one block of the file through the fast
001670                    ; path and through the FAT32 library and compare byte for byte.
001671                    ; R8: FDH, R9/R10: block index lo/hi
001672                    ; Returns R8: 0 = identical, 1 = no fast path, else difference index + 2
001673  83A6  FF90  005E  CHKBLK                      ASUB enter, 1
001674  83A8  0800                                    MOVE R8, R0
001675  83A9  0904                                    MOVE R9, R1
001676  83AA  0A08                                    MOVE R10, R2
001677                    
001678  83AB  0020                                    MOVE R0, R8
001679  83AC  0124                                    MOVE R1, R9
001680  83AD  0228                                    MOVE R2, R10
