002437                    ; SDB_LBA
002438                    ; Maps a block index within the file to an absolute SD card LBA.
002439                    ;
002440                    ; Input: R8: pointer to the block map
002441                    ; R9/R10: block index lo/hi
002442                    ; Output: Carry=1: R9/R10 = LBA lo/hi
002443                    ; Carry=0: the block cannot be mapped (use the FAT32 library)
002444                    ; R8 unchanged
