002446  862E  0800                                    MOVE R8, R0                      ; R0: map
002447  862F  0904                                    MOVE R9, R1                      ; R1/R2: remaining block idx
002448  8630  0A08                                    MOVE R10, R2
002449  8631  004C                                    MOVE @R0, R3                     ; R3: amount of extents
002450  8632  FFA3  0037                              RBRA _SDBL_NO, Z
