002495                    
002496                    ; Unsigned 32-bit "A >= B" for two little-endian word pairs in memory.
002497                    ; The answer is returned in the Carry flag and not in N/Z, because MOVE @R13++, R15 is
002498                    ; a MOVE (see sysdef.asm) and a MOVE overwrites N and Z but not the Carry.
002499                    ; Input: R8: pointer to A (lo, hi), R9: pointer to B (lo, hi)
002500                    ; Output: Carry=1 if A >= B, R8 and R9 unchanged
